    "title": "pandas.DatetimeIndex.day — pandas 3.0.5 documentation",
    "status": 200,
    "markdown": "# pandas.DatetimeIndex.day#\n\n- property DatetimeIndex.day[source]#\n- The day of the datetime. See also \n  - `DatetimeIndex.year`\n  - The year of the datetime.\n  - `DatetimeIndex.month`\n  - The month as January=1, December=12.\n  - `DatetimeIndex.hour`\n  - The hours of the datetime.\n Examples >>> datetime_series = pd.Series( ... pd.date_range(\"2000-01-01\", periods=3, freq=\"D\") ... ) >>> datetime_series 0 2000-01-01 1 2000-01-02 2 2000-01-03 dtype: datetime64[us] >>> datetime_series.dt.day 0 1 1 2 2 3 dtype: int32",
